{
 "duration": 24.628,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ava hikes in her favorite cotton hoodie.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.403
  },
  {
   "text": "On the climb she sweats, and the hoodie soaks it up and stays wet.",
   "start": 2.653,
   "end": 6.011
  },
  {
   "text": "At the windy top, she's shivering.",
   "start": 6.261,
   "end": 7.985
  },
  {
   "text": "Cotton holds water and loses its warmth when wet.",
   "start": 8.285,
   "end": 11.214
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Wear a synthetic or wool base layer,",
   "start": 11.564,
   "end": 14.725
  },
  {
   "text": "and a fleece as your warm layer.",
   "start": 14.875,
   "end": 16.599
  },
  {
   "text": "Fleece keeps much of its warmth when damp and dries fast.",
   "start": 16.849,
   "end": 19.997
  },
  {
   "text": "Ava zips up at the top, warm.",
   "start": 20.347,
   "end": 22.097
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 22.397,
   "end": 24.428
  }
 ],
